### 2. Backend Server Actions

#### [NEW] [courses.ts](file:///C:/Users/Fadil/.gemini/antigravity-ide/scratch/custom-lms/src/actions/courses.ts)
Type-safe Server Actions for teacher operations:
- `createCourseAction(formData)`: Validates title, slug, description, thumbnail_url, price, status; resolves logged-in teacher ID; inserts into `courses`; redirects to `/teacher/courses/${id}/builder`.
- `updateCourseAction(courseId, data)`: Updates course details and publication status (`draft` / `published`).
- `deleteCourseAction(courseId)`: Deletes course and cascaded relations.
- `createModuleAction(courseId, title, description)`: Inserts new module with calculated next `order_index`.
- `deleteModuleAction(moduleId, courseId)`: Removes module.
- `createLessonAction(moduleId, courseId, data)`: Inserts new lesson (Title, Slug, LessonType [video/text], VideoURL, Content, Duration, Free Preview).
- `updateLessonAction(lessonId, courseId, data)`: Updates lesson content or video link.
- `deleteLessonAction(lessonId, courseId)`: Removes lesson.
- `reorderCurriculumAction(type: 'modules' | 'lessons', parentId, items: { id, orderIndex }[])`: Updates order indexes in batch.

